    {"type":"text","id":"callout_text","x":90,"y":770,"width":1700,"height":60,"text":"five different shapes for five different jobs.  pinned cards stay put.  tilted sticky notes might fall off.  cloud bubbles are guesses.  clock cards have alarms.  the scroll is wisdom.\nthe agent's job is triage — its memory is built for triage.  a flat list of \"facts\" gives the recruiter cold pitch the same weight as Mary's deadline.  this doesn't.","originalText":"five different shapes for five different jobs.  pinned cards stay put.  tilted sticky notes might fall off.  cloud bubbles are guesses.  clock cards have alarms.  the scroll is wisdom.\nthe agent's job is triage — its memory is built for triage.  a flat list of \"facts\" gives the recruiter cold pitch the same weight as Mary's deadline.  this doesn't.","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#7c2d12","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":570002,"version":1,"versionNonce":570002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"callout","lineHeight":1.4}
